    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p>The below Hazards include all Hazards likely to occur in Arctic environments: </p><table class=\"sortable wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>NAME </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>KEYWORDS </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unknown_Regions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unknown Regions\">Unknown Regions</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Icy_Ground\" title=\"Icy Ground\">Icy Ground</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Artificial or Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blizzard\" title=\"Blizzard\">Blizzard</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 3 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Freezing_Rain\" title=\"Freezing Rain\">Freezing Rain</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 4 </td> \n   <td>Atmosphere, Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Frozen_Lake\" title=\"Frozen Lake\">Frozen Lake</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 6 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Icy_Cliffs\" title=\"Icy Cliffs\">Icy Cliffs</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 9 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Avalanche\" title=\"Avalanche\">Avalanche</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 10 </td> \n   <td>Natural </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
